    "updated_at": "2021-12-09T03:45:09Z",
    "body": "Hmm, saving the pointer to the SFNSP in the history item might be a little bit awkward as it's in different layers (at least in Chrome's implementation), but maybe it's doable if we only retain it when staying in the document. I'm worried this breaks stuff like single page apps that don't expect focus to jump around with their same-document history navigation though. Maybe others can comment better on that.",
