    "updated_at": "2021-12-09T16:03:32Z",
    "body": "> I'm worried this breaks stuff like single page apps that don't expect focus to jump around with their same-document history navigation though.\r\n\r\nI can try to find some examples. This would only be SPAs that still use hash routing, correct? I would assume SPAs using the history API wouldn't be effected since they don't use hashes/fragments.",
