    "created_at": "2022-01-04T18:06:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-01-04T18:06:01Z",
    "body": "I did manage to find a site still using hash routing: https://reading.summon.serialssolutions.com/search?s.q=cats#!/search?ho=t&l=en&q=cats\r\n\r\nIt doesn't appear to have any explicit focus handling. The focus behavior is actually non-deterministic, oddly enough. If you...\r\n\r\n1. Load the page, TAB to the \"Full-text online\" checkbox in the \"Refine your search\" sidebar, press SPACE\r\n2. Press TAB (focus moves to the next checkbox, which seems good)\r\n3. Go back, then press TAB\r\n\r\nSometimes focus will still be on a sidebar checkbox, sometimes it resets to the top of the sidebar. If you go forward in history, focus gets thrown to the right-hand sidebar.",
